Eduka-Low (Eduka-Low-Theme) - Edukasaun OS theme for very low spec computers.

GTK 2/3/4: Yaru-remix (default flavour) by Muqtxdir,
https://github.com/Muqtxdir/yaru-remix - GTK code GPL-3.0 (see COPYING),
assets CC BY-SA 4.0 (see LICENSE_CCBYSA). Built unchanged with
meson -Dgtk=true (default flavour only); folder renamed to Eduka-Low.
xfwm4 and Openbox borders: generated by tools/gen-wm-themes.py with the
Yaru-remix palette (headerbar #323030, accent #315bef, red #c7162b).
Eduka-Panel, Eduka-Desktop and Eduka-Settings draw their own flat, opaque
Eduka-Low look; transparency, the compositor and effects are switched off.
